--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Chart fixtures
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Files under `charts/` are chart files in the DTX format family (DTX, BMS,
BME, GDA, G2D). Where a chart is a third-party work, it is included here
solely as a conformance fixture — to pin how a parser must behave on real
input — and is NOT covered by this repository's MIT licence. Each such chart
retains the rights of its original author.

Charts authored for this repository are covered by the MIT licence along with
everything else, and are marked as such in `charts/<slug>/PROVENANCE.md`.

Every chart carries a `PROVENANCE.md` recording where it came from and why it
is here. A chart without one is a defect, and `scripts/validate.mjs` fails the
build on it.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Relationship to DTXMania
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The DTX format family originates with DTXMania (Copyright (C) 2000-2010
DTXMania Group), which is distributed under the MIT License. This repository
contains an independent description of the format and conformance fixtures
for it; it includes no DTXMania source code.
